{
  "name": "Inquisitor's Gaze",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you use Cunning Action: Aim, you can choose one creature you can see. You have Advantage on the first Attack Roll against that creature each turn for 1 minute instead. This effect ends early if you can no longer see the target, you are Incapacitated, you perform a hostile action against a different creature (such as an attack or forcing it to make a Saving Throw), or you use Inquisitor's Gaze on a different creature.</p>",
